# CELL-WR-07: Ports with use only, class only, all three attributes, use=reset; save.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/scmos -noprompt
snap internal
load a
box 0 0 40 10
paint metal1
box 2 2 2 2
label u
port make
port use power
box 12 2 12 2
label c
port make
port class input
box 22 2 22 2
label all
port make
port use ground
port class output
port shape abutment
box 32 2 32 2
label r
port make
port use reset
save a
